.TH Command ANNOUNCE
.SY "announce [(file]]"
The announce command is a variant of the telegram command.
It sends your message to \fIall\fR players in the game.
This convenient service costs money, however, ($100).
.s3
In all other respects it is the same as telegram; length is limited
to 512 characters, the text of the announcement can be supplied
in a file, etc.
.s3
For example:
.EX announce
.NF
Enter telegram for everyone; end with ^D
 512 left:
 511 left:               For Immediate Release
 475 left:                     from
 447 left:                 Groonland Embassy
 413 left:
 412 left:
 440 left: HELP!  Curmudgeon just TRASHED our capital!  We had even proposed
 345 left: a very fair treaty, but they did it anyway!  People of the World,
 279 left: UNITE!  Overthrow the slavemasters of Curmudgeon!
 229 left: <EOT>
.FI
.s3
See also : prayers, read, telegram
